         "step": 1,
         "text": "The numerator has the form \\( f(\\frac{\\pi}{6} + h) - f(\\frac{\\pi}{6}) \\) with \\( f(x) = \\cos x \\), because \\( f(\\frac{\\pi}{6}) = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\).",
