            "Divide",
            "Pi",
            6
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "The limit is the definition of \\( f'(\\frac{\\pi}{6}) \\), and \\( f'(x) = - \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\).",
